    "skill": "---\nname: conversation\ndescription: Collect and confirm a premium or standard membership request\nextends: action:jvagent/interview\ninterview:\n  title: Membership request\n  summary: Collect and confirm a membership selection without external effects\n  confirm: manual\n  fields:\n    - key: tier\n      prompt: Premium or standard membership?\n      required: true\n      validator: text\n      branches:\n        - when: {op: equals, value: premium}\n          goto: premium_note\n      else: standard_note\n    - key: premium_note\n      prompt: What premium detail should I record?\n      required: true\n      validator: text\n      else: email\n    - key: standard_note\n      prompt: What standard detail should I record?\n      required: true\n      validator: text\n      else: email\n    - key: email\n      prompt: What email address should I record?\n      required: true\n      validator: email\n---\nUse the inherited procedure to collect and review the reachable membership fields.\nNormalize tier to lowercase premium or standard. Store explicit supplied details\nusing interview__set_fields. A correction can change the branch: follow the tool's\nreachable fields and pruned_fields, preserve the already stored shared email, and\nshow a fresh review before waiting for a new confirmation. Do not complete against\nan earlier review of different values. Do not claim to register, contact, or charge\nanyone; this is an isolated intake demonstration with no external effects.\n",
